            <h1 class="section-heading">Explore CineFiles</h1>
            <p>
              CineFiles is an ongoing project of the <a href="https://bampfa.org" aria-label="website for the berkeley art musueum and pacific film archive">BAMPFA</a> Film Library and Study Center. This website contains scans of reviews, press kits, film festival and repertory theater programs, articles, and other film ephemera from our extensive library collections.
            </p>
            <p>
              Some documents are restricted due to copyright and require a free <a href="/users/sign_up" aria-label="create an account">account</a> to access. Read about CineFiles accounts, our privacy policy, and more <a href="https://bampfa.org/cinefiles/about/accounts/" aria-label="read about cinefiles accounts and this website's privacy policy">here</a>.
            </p>
          </div>
          <article
            aria-labelledby="flip-card-0-heading"
            aria-roledescription="flip card"
            class="isotope-item"
            role="tooltip"
            tabindex="0"
          >
            <div class="flipper">
              <div class="front">
                <img src="/cinefiles_program-71.jpg" alt="pacific film archive program for the film series, 'science fiction as prophecy'">
                <div id="flip-card-0-heading" class="flipper-text minor-heading">Five decades of film at BAMPFA</div>
                <div class="flipper-text-bg"></div>
              </div>
              <div class="back">
                <p class="minor-heading">Film at BAMPFA since 1971</p>
                <p class="desc">In 1971 the Pacific Film Archive began its celebrated film exhibition program. BAMPFA continues to offer a diverse repertory slate of <a href="https://bampfa.org/visit/calendar" aria-label="view the current bampfa art and film program calendar">over 450 screenings</a> each year. Explore programs from our first decade (and beyond!).</p>
                <p class="citation">Program for the 1971 film series, "Science Fiction as Prophecy"</p>
                <p class="py-1">
                  <a
                    href="/?author_txt=&country_txt=&director_txt=&doclanguage_txt=&docnamesubject_txt=&doctype_txt=&film_id_ss=&filmlanguage_txt=&filmyear_txt=&op=AND&pubdate_txt=&range[pubdate_i][begin]=1971&range[pubdate_i][end]=1976&search_field=advanced&sort=pubdatescalar_s+asc&source_txt=pacific+film+archive&text=&title_txt="
                    aria-label="Learn more about 50 plus years of film at BAMPFA"
                    class="btn btn-primary"
                  >
                    Learn more
                  </a>
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>

