                <p class="desc">BAMPFA <a href="https://bampfa.org/program/special-screenings" aria-label="check out bampfa's ongoing presentations of cinema classics">regularly screens</a> favorites of world cinema. In our ongoing series of special screenings, recent releases, restored classics, and special guests grace the Barbro Osher Theater at BAMPFA.</p>
                <p class="citation">Film still for <cite>Pierrot le fou</cite> (Jean-luc Godard, 1965), playing July 12th.</p>
