              </div>
              <div class="back">
                <p class="minor-heading">Stanley Kubrick</p>
                <p class="desc">This summer, BAMPFA presents a <a href="https://bampfa.org/program/complete-stanley-kubrick" aria-label="purchase tickets for bampfa's stanley kubrick retrospective">complete retrospective</a> of Stanley Kubrick's filmography. Stanley Kubrick created some of the most revered works in cinema history, both critically lauded and hugely successful at the box office, while maintaining a singular vision across genres.</p>
                <p class="citation">Still from <cite>The Shining</cite> (Stanly Kubrick, 1980)</p>
                <p class="py-1">
