                <p class="minor-heading">Isao Takahata</p>
                <p class="desc">This summer, BAMPFA celebrates the work of Studio Ghibli co-founder, <a href="https://bampfa.org/program/some-nostalgic-place-films-isao-takahata" aria-label="view the full program details of bampfa's Isao Takahata retrospective">Isao Takahata</a>. During his sixty-year career as a director of hand-drawn animation, Takahata pushed the medium into uncharted territories. View our collection of Studio Ghibli ephemera on CineFiles.</p>
                <p class="citation">Still from <cite>Pom Poko</cite> (Takahata, 1994)</p>
